### Bulk Delete Calls
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/method/tatva_connect.api.partner_call.call_delete_bulk
Authorization: token {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "names": ["{{callName}}", "{{callName2}}"]
